 \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Coffee blossom, Orange, Nectarine, Pineapple, Mango, Red plum, Juicy\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          这款日晒的果汁感很强，高温入口时是优雅的咖啡花香还有偏红色花的花香，混合着香橙的甜，然后转油桃的果皮加果肉的质感，甚至还有一些菠萝和芒果的果香，中温后能感受到似红布林的核果的风味。整体的酸质上扬，中等偏高，口感圆润扎实，带一点粘稠的触感～特别棒，强烈推荐！！！\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R2ZL2IQWptibaeWeAYGhNsLX7QepnsdiaPBh0Vlnn6mmHvuNq4EaJhibz1HzVVHxxVahJ4lNt4VYGgQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 578px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(53, 53, 53);color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: start;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n