     ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ReEobaKx9mnXlz48aHcqFrqZwQOpIIxPiatft2bMDqT8gKsQ2IiaT0b3MQ2wP19jZQqicfY8nbFIzhA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          Testi PLC是由Faysel Abdosh于2009年创立的，目前下属管理超过20个处理站，服务覆盖超过315公顷的咖啡种植基地，年出口超过1200个货柜的咖啡豆；像我们现在在售卖的圣塔维尼，Bura以及之前卖过的Adorsi和Yaye都是Testi旗下的招牌产品。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           Testi在哈拉尔部族语言里是快乐幸福 “Happiness”的意思，也是Faysel的一个儿子的名字。\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n            本批次处理方式\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span style='outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          选取90%成熟红果，10%过度成熟果混合进行浮选，在这个过程中，鲜果在水里浸泡15分钟，去除带来苦涩风味的未成熟果及密度低的漂浮果，给成熟红果及过熟果更多空间，激发鲜果中更多的水果风味，而后将咖啡鲜果放置在晒床上，晒床设置在阴凉通风处，每张晒床120kg咖啡鲜果尽可能薄地铺平，在遮荫网下缓慢干燥30天。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
